#. (itstool) path: sect2/title
#: C/index.docbook:476
msgid "Customizing Behavior"
msgstr "Әрекетті баптау"

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:477
msgid ""
"To customize the behavior of <application>Sticky Notes</application>, right-"
